      "scope": "For a rational coordinate subspace and full-rank integer columns in that subspace, define their actual integer span as a submodule of the full integer-point lattice. Identify the cardinality of the quotient with the absolute determinant of the column-coordinate matrix in an actual integer basis, prove that cardinality positive, and prove the exact identity Gram determinant = quotient cardinality squared times full lattice covolume squared. All dimension, containment and positive Gram hypotheses remain explicit; no quotient-cardinality or saturation identity is assumed. This candidate changes no accepted registry.",
